@startuml usecase-application-review

title 使用案例3.2: 申請審核作業 (BP-APPLICATION-005)

actor "送養者\n(一般會員或收容所會員)" as Owner
participant "ApplicationReview.vue" as Vue
participant "applications.ts" as API
participant "applications.py" as Blueprint
participant "application_service.py" as Service
participant "permission_service.py" as Permission
participant "notification_service.py" as Notification
participant "audit_service.py" as Audit
participant "Application Model" as ApplicationModel
participant "Animal Model" as AnimalModel
participant "Database" as DB

== 先決條件：進入申請列表瀏覽 ==
Owner -> Vue: 導航到「領養申請管理」頁面
activate Vue
Vue -> API: getApplications({mode: "review"})
activate API
API -> Blueprint: GET /applications?mode=review
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
Blueprint -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id = ?
DB --> Blueprint: current_user 資料

note right of Blueprint
  權限過濾邏輯：
  mode="review" 表示只查詢
  別人對自己動物的申請
  
  查詢條件：
  1. 查詢個人送養動物的申請
     (owner_id = current_user_id)
  2. 如果是收容所會員，也查詢
     所屬收容所動物的申請
     (shelter_id = primary_shelter_id)
end note

Blueprint -> DB: SELECT animal_id FROM animals\nWHERE (owner_id = ? OR shelter_id = ?)\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> Blueprint: owned_animal_ids[]

Blueprint -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE animal_id IN (owned_animal_ids)\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY created_at DESC
DB --> Blueprint: applications[]

Blueprint --> API: 200 OK\n{items: [...], total, page, pages}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Vue: {items: [...], total, page, pages}
deactivate API

Vue -> Vue: 計算統計數據\n(待審核、審核中、已通過、已拒絕)
Vue -> User: 顯示申請列表與統計卡片
deactivate Vue

== 步驟1: 顯示申請詳細資料 ==
Owner -> Vue: 點擊某個待審核申請
activate Vue
Vue -> Owner: 顯示申請卡片詳細資訊
note right of Owner
  申請卡片包含：
  - 申請人資訊
    (姓名/帳號、申請時間)
  - 動物資訊
    (照片、名稱、物種、品種、性別、年齡)
  - 申請人詳細資料
    (聯絡電話、地址、職業、
     居住環境、飼養經驗、領養原因)
  - 狀態標籤
    (PENDING/UNDER_REVIEW/APPROVED/REJECTED)
end note

== 步驟2: 檢視申請內容與相關資料 ==
Owner -> Vue: 檢視申請人資訊與動物詳情
Owner -> Vue: 點擊「查看動物」按鈕 (可選)
opt 查看完整動物資訊
    Vue -> Owner: 導航到動物詳情頁面
    Owner -> Vue: 查看動物完整資訊與醫療紀錄
    Owner -> Vue: 返回申請審核頁面
end

== 步驟3: 進行審核評估 ==
Owner -> Vue: 評估申請人條件
note right of Owner
  評估項目：
  - 聯絡方式是否完整
  - 居住環境是否適合
  - 是否有飼養經驗
  - 領養動機是否合理
  - 其他備註事項
end note

== 步驟4: 填寫審核意見 ==
Owner -> Vue: 點擊「通過」或「拒絕」按鈕
Vue -> Owner: 顯示審核 Modal

note right of Owner
  Modal 內容包含：
  - 申請人資訊摘要
  - 動物資訊摘要
  - 審核備註輸入框
  - 確認按鈕
  
  送養人資訊提示：
  「您就是送養人，這是別人
  對您動物的領養申請」
end note

Owner -> Vue: 輸入審核備註
note right: 通過：原因或注意事項\n拒絕：拒絕的理由

== 步驟5: 選擇審核結果 ==
Owner -> Vue: 點擊「確認通過」或「確認拒絕」

Vue -> API: reviewApplication(application_id,\n  {action: "approve"/"reject", review_notes, version})
activate API
API -> Blueprint: POST /applications/{application_id}/review\n{action, review_notes, version}
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
Blueprint -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id = ?
DB --> Blueprint: current_user (reviewer)

Blueprint -> Service: review_application(\n  application_id, reviewer,\n  action, review_notes, expected_version)
activate Service

Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE application_id = ?\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> Service: Application 資料

Service -> Permission: can_review_application(\n  reviewer, application)
activate Permission

Permission -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = ?
DB --> Permission: Animal 資料

Permission -> Permission: 檢查權限
note right of Permission
  權限檢查邏輯：
  1. 管理員不能審核
     (領養申請應由送養人審核)
  2. 必須是動物擁有者
     (owner_id = reviewer_id)
  3. 或者是收容所成員且動物
     屬於該收容所
     (shelter_id = primary_shelter_id)
end note

Permission --> Service: True/False
deactivate Permission

alt 無權限審核
    Service --> Blueprint: PermissionDeniedError
    Blueprint --> API: 403 Forbidden\n{message: "只有送養人或收容所成員可以審核此申請"}
    API --> Vue: Error
    Vue -> Owner: 顯示錯誤訊息「無權限審核」
else 檢查申請狀態
    Service -> Service: 檢查 status\n(必須是 PENDING 或 UNDER_REVIEW)
    alt 狀態不符
        Service --> Blueprint: ValidationError
        Blueprint --> API: 400 Bad Request\n{message: "此申請無法審核"}
        API --> Vue: Error
        Vue -> Owner: 顯示錯誤訊息
    else 樂觀鎖檢查
        Service -> Service: 檢查 version
        note right: 防止並發修改
        alt 版本衝突
            Service --> Blueprint: ConflictError
            Blueprint --> API: 409 Conflict\n{message: "申請已被其他人修改，請重新載入"}
            API --> Vue: Error
            Vue -> Owner: 顯示錯誤訊息「請重新整理」
        else 審核成功
            Service -> ApplicationModel: 更新申請狀態
            note right of Service
              如果 action = "approve":
                application.status = APPROVED
                animal.status = ADOPTED
              如果 action = "reject":
                application.status = REJECTED
              
              共同更新：
                assignee_id = reviewer.user_id
                reviewed_at = now()
                review_notes = review_notes
                version += 1
            end note
            
            ApplicationModel -> DB: UPDATE applications\nSET status=?, assignee_id=?,\nreviewed_at=?, review_notes=?,\nversion=?\nWHERE application_id=?
            DB --> ApplicationModel: 1 row affected
            
            alt action = "approve"
                Service -> AnimalModel: animal.status = ADOPTED
                AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status="ADOPTED", updated_at=?\nWHERE animal_id=?
                DB --> AnimalModel: 1 row affected
            end
            
            ApplicationModel --> Service: Application
            
            Service -> Audit: log_application_review(\n  application_id, reviewer_id,\n  old_status, new_status)
            activate Audit
            Audit -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs
            DB --> Audit: audit_log_id
            Audit --> Service: 審計日誌已記錄
            deactivate Audit
            
            Service -> Notification: notify_application_reviewed(\n  application, reviewer_id,\n  status, review_notes)
            activate Notification
            note right of Notification
              發送通知給申請人：
              - 審核結果 (通過/拒絕)
              - 審核備註
              - 動物資訊
            end note
            Notification -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications
            DB --> Notification: notification_id
            Notification --> Service: 通知已發送
            deactivate Notification
            
            Service --> Blueprint: Application
            Blueprint --> API: 200 OK\n{message: "申請已核准/拒絕", application: {...}}
        end
    end
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Vue: {application: {status, review_notes, ...}}
deactivate API

== 步驟6: 系統通知使用者審核結果 ==
Vue -> Vue: closeReviewModal()\nclearSelection()
Vue -> Vue: 重新載入申請列表
Vue -> API: getApplications({mode: "review"})
API --> Vue: 更新後的申請列表

Vue -> Owner: 顯示成功訊息
note right of Owner
  「申請已通過」或「申請已拒絕」
  
  申請狀態更新：
  - APPROVED (已通過)
  - REJECTED (已拒絕)
  
  如果通過：
  - 動物狀態變更為 ADOPTED
  - 該動物不再顯示在公開清單
end note

Vue -> Owner: 更新統計卡片數據
deactivate Vue

== 後置條件確認 ==
note over Owner, DB
  ✓ 申請狀態已更新 (APPROVED/REJECTED)
  ✓ 審核意見已記錄
  ✓ 審核者資訊已記錄 (assignee_id)
  ✓ 審核時間已記錄 (reviewed_at)
  ✓ 如果核准，動物狀態變更為 ADOPTED
  ✓ 如果核准，該動物不會在公開清單顯示
  ✓ 申請人收到審核結果通知
  ✓ 審計日誌已記錄
  ✓ 管理員不能審核送養申請
end note

== 輔助說明 ==
note over Owner, DB
  管理員角色限制：
  - 管理員可以查看所有申請
  - 但管理員不能審核送養申請
  - 只有送養者本人可以審核
  
  審核權限檢查：
  1. 個人送養：owner_id = reviewer_id
  2. 收容所送養：shelter_id = reviewer.primary_shelter_id
     且 reviewer.role = SHELTER_MEMBER
  
  審核後動物狀態：
  - 核准後：animal.status = ADOPTED
  - 拒絕後：animal.status 不變
  - 已領養的動物不會出現在公開清單
end note

@enduml
